# Cursor Orchestrator — Playwright Project

- Tests live in `tests/` as `*.spec.ts` files
- Page Objects live in `pages/` — one class per page
- Shared fixtures are in `fixtures/pom/index.ts` (single import point)
- Run `npm test` to execute all tests; `npm run test:chrome` or `npm run test:firefox` for a single browser
